  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二十一关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "怎麼有這麼多整合運動！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "誒呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "只有我一個人覺得敵人越來越多了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "啊呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "不是錯覺。很明顯，整合運動的增援到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "可惡，我們甚至還沒向他們報一箭之仇——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "結果，倒是他們先找上羅德島了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "芙蘭卡，看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "東邊的出口，藏匿著的可能是整合運動的術師。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "正面的通道，兩側的高層建築裡，也有大量的整合運動暴徒——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "......想要裝出沒發現我們的樣子摸過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "這可是在......樓頂啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "無論來多少敵人，被打下去的話就會立刻完蛋了吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "感覺我這聰明頭腦被人小看了呢，整合運動居然選這裡和我們作戰......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "整合運動，是要發動總攻了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "全體幹員，重整隊形！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "等等，我好像——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "看到了整合運動之前那個指揮官？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "......羅德島。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "你們，把她交給龍門了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "（芙蘭卡，必須先震懾整合運動的敵人！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "（趁他們不敢繼續進攻的時候，向低層轉移！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "（現在必須要擴大戰場！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "（知道了，那就邊跑邊打吧！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "與你有什麼關係？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "......你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "我的同胞，動手吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
